    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d69">

                <pb facs="0129" n="117" sameAs="frus:frus1944v03/pg117"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt to
                        the British Prime Minister</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Churchill</hi>)<anchor n="25" xml:id="d69-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1944-06-07">7 June, 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>554. I am sorry to learn that Sir William Brown and staff departure has been
                    delayed. I personally hope much that they can come as quickly as possible, as
                    the situation is becoming embarrassing.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Roosevelt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
